Both of you turn to blue crystals and get teleported to a city. You look at yourself to see that you now have a breastplate. You immediately recognize the city as The Starters town. You look around to see that they haven't changed the first city a lot but you don't see RadiantRose around.

You see a fountain at the centre. It's huge.
There are a lot of buildings around you.
There is a weaponsmith, a tailor, a Inn, a shop and a lot of houses.

